        "Title": "The Final Test Silent Speedrun: Level 3",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ICA_FACILITY",
        "PublicId": "101260061393",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/thefacility/_scene_polarbear_005.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 579f2544-1970-4865-afa3-ad4566e5f98d).Image",
        "Description": "Initiate? What on earth are you doing there, didn&apos;t you get the memo? The training facility is closed down, at least for a while. Someone used one of the firearms. We had spares in the back, someone used it, and now none of them are acting right. Listen, just finish your session, it&apos;s safe than trying to leave in the middle of training. We have one more session for tomorrow, a new initiate. You&apos;ll be in field duty. For now, just make it through the test. Ok, good night, and good luck.",
